      "instance_name": "white_crackers_pun",
      "label": "Pun on 'white' meaning bland or unremarkable",
      "description": "The meme relies on a wordplay where 'white crackers' (a literal food item) is juxtaposed with the phrase 'that's right' to imply that the crackers are so plain, generic, or unexciting that it's obvious or even boring. This pun requires understanding of how 'white' can be used metaphorically to describe something bland or lacking in flavor or interest, which is a common cultural reference in humor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_a1848535"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
