      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "generic_food_stereotype",
      "label": "Stereotype of bland, unremarkable food",
      "description": "The humor in the meme depends on the cultural understanding that certain foods, especially plain white crackers, are seen as bland, unexciting, or 'basic' — often used as a metaphor for something unremarkable or lacking in depth. This stereotype is part of broader cultural perceptions about food and taste.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
